  (text "智慧香爐 P0 — 兩板系統電路圖" (at 14.00 20.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 6.00 6.00)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6d2688fa-35de-4f27-a598-75be7662b760"))
  (text "訊號以導線直接連接；電源網路（GND / +5V / +12V）採電源符號，同名符號即同一網路（GND 接點多，拉線會過於雜亂）。" (at 14.00 27.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "406dbdf1-9fa4-423f-854a-ed8e8e55666e"))
  (text "★ 合併架構：感測 ＋ 安全 ＋ 致動 同在 MATRIX Mini R4 ★" (at 14.00 172.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 3.20 3.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "990a7fc1-9dd9-4498-aaca-66a161ef2964"))
  (text "SCD41 與 SHT31 以 Grove 線直插 I2C1 / I2C2 埠（5V，兩顆晶片皆支援 2.4-5.5V，不需電平轉換）。" (at 14.00 179.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4fce9b9d-27bf-46fe-8c13-d0e081ab8037"))
  (text "各 I2C 埠經 PCA9548A 多工器（位址 0x70）彼此獨立，韌體存取前需切通道：寫入 (1 << 通道)。" (at 14.00 185.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c2206207-b156-41b1-9e8b-088d605974db"))
  (text "原三板架構的「S3 GPIO4 → R4 警報線」已取消——感測與安全同在一顆 MCU，不需跨板訊號，" (at 14.00 191.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fa595aa8-b6c6-4600-8f58-c884bddfa891"))
  (text "連帶不再需要 3.3V→5V 電平轉換與 10k 下拉電阻。" (at 14.00 197.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "27c02bbb-77b2-4edb-a49e-4941761ce7ea"))
  (text "★ 腳位限制：不可使用 D2、D3 埠 ★" (at 14.00 207.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 3.20 3.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "09dd42a5-a892-4e3c-ac03-6b6133a95e44"))
  (text "MiniR4.begin() 內執行 PS2.config_gamepad(11, 4, 12, 5)，把 D2 埠(5,4) 與 D3 埠(12,11) 佔為手把介面。" (at 14.00 214.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "516dde98-42d7-432d-88e7-b0c608922b51"))
  (text "本設計僅用 D1 埠(3,2) 與 D4 埠(13,10)；風扇 PWM 必須落在 3/5/10/11 其中之一。" (at 14.00 220.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "44b73138-7551-4141-8aee-f269587e7a18"))
  (text "★ 電源與共地 ★" (at 14.00 230.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 3.20 3.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c5252894-2c35-4cc7-9ccc-6b2d66d53571"))
  (text "一顆 12V 2A 同時餵控制器（板子吃 6-24V）與 D4184，共地自動成立——省去原設計最易翻車的地線母排。" (at 14.00 237.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "86c87969-3fee-4146-95f6-22b5fb69c6a9"))
  (text "馬達埠是 5V（Port M1 DC 5V Motor），推不動 12V 風扇，故 D4184 MOSFET 模組必須保留。" (at 14.00 243.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "904e3280-c9d6-43cc-966c-a54a5a57f490"))
  (text "12V 僅進 D4184 VIN± 與控制器電源輸入，不可碰到 5V 排。" (at 14.00 249.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4ea51c27-9390-4382-8a8e-aa9e980ded10"))
  (text "感測器與 MAX6675 的 5V/GND 實體上隨埠線一同供給，圖上以電源符號表示。" (at 14.00 259.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.20 2.20)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bace9113-53c6-4ea3-996e-5cebc8666b5d"))
  (text "I2C 線長上限約 1-2 公尺（100kHz、模組內建 10k 上拉）；感測頭若需更遠，改回三板架構走 WiFi。" (at 14.00 265.00 0)
